{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98000","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98000/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98000/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98000/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98000","id":2574622410,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc5-BI-5","number":98000,"title":"GDScript: support variable declarations as condition for if-statement","user":{"login":"zjin123","id":184326668,"node_id":"U_kgDOCvyaDA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184326668?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zjin123","html_url":"https://github.com/zjin123","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zjin123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zjin123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zjin123/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zjin123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zjin123/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zjin123/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zjin123/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zjin123/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zjin123/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","color":"4466ff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2024-10-09T03:13:18Z","updated_at":"2024-10-24T09:41:36Z","closed_at":"2024-10-09T13:20:46Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98000","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98000","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98000.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98000.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nImplement https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/2727 for if-statement.\r\n\r\nThis implementation is simple and intuitive but not elegant.\r\n\r\nIdea is to parse code like\r\n\r\n```\r\nif var a := foo():\r\n    do_something(a)\r\nelse:\r\n    do_other_thing()\r\n\r\nif a > b, var c := bar(a, b), c > d:\r\n    do_something(c)\r\nelse:\r\n    do_other_thing()\r\n```\r\n\r\ninto code llike\r\n\r\n```\r\nif true:\r\n    var a := foo()\r\n    if a:                           # jump address when !a will be patched to\r\n        do_something(a)\r\nelse:                               # ... here\r\n    do_other_thing()\r\n\r\nif true:\r\n    if a > b:                       # all of jump address when !(a>b)\r\n        var c := bar(a, b)\r\n        if c:                       # ... and jump address when !c\r\n            if c > d:               # ... and jump address when !(c>d)\r\n                do_something(c)\r\nelse:                               # ... will be patched to here\r\n    do_other_thing()\r\n```\r\n\r\nSuch transform will guarantee short-circuit evaluation and scope visibility.\r\n\r\nSemantics will be ensured by patching jump addresses (as above) duration compilation.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"zjin123","id":184326668,"node_id":"U_kgDOCvyaDA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184326668?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zjin123","html_url":"https://github.com/zjin123","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zjin123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zjin123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zjin123/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zjin123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zjin123/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zjin123/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zjin123/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zjin123/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zjin123/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98000/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98000/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}